  "prefLabel": "Env-A 3203.10 Allowance transfer deadline",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Env-A 3203.10 “Allowance transfer deadline” means 12:01 a.m. on December 1 and is the deadline for recording allowances in a budget source’s compliance or overdraft account for purposes of meeting the requirements of this chapter for the preceding control period.\n\nSource. #11001, eff 1-1-16; ss by #14632, eff 6-25-26, EXPIRES: 6-25-36",
